msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:114
msgid "Reduce motion in fullscreen mode"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:115
msgid ""
"Hold Home's animated background on its first frame and change art without a "
"crossfade in fullscreen mode. Turning off animations in the system settings "
"does the same."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:119
msgid "Larger text in fullscreen mode"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:120
msgid ""
"Show fullscreen mode's text about a quarter larger, for reading from across "
"the room. The desktop window is not affected."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:124
msgid "Custom fullscreen style"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:125
msgid ""
"Restyle fullscreen mode with your own stylesheet, fullscreen.css in the "
"app's config folder. The desktop window is not affected."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:129
msgid "Fullscreen design"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:130
msgid ""
"The id of the design fullscreen mode is shown in: a theme folder shipped "
"with the app or in the app's config folder under themes. Empty for Adwaita, "
"the standard look. The desktop window is not affected."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:134
msgid "Fullscreen design variant"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:135
msgid ""
"The id of the chosen variant of the fullscreen design, for a design that "
"offers variants; its stylesheet applies after the design's own. An empty or "
"unknown id picks the design's first variant."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:144
msgid "Fullscreen background blur"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:145
msgid ""
"How much Home's background and the focused game's art behind it are blurred "
"in fullscreen mode. A design can restyle each strength."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:154
msgid "Fullscreen background dim"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.tim_van_oudheusden.pindu-launcher.gschema.xml.in:155
msgid ""
"How much Home's background and the focused game's art behind it are darkened "
"in fullscreen mode. A design can restyle each strength."
msgstr ""

